halt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T17:54:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T17:58:27Z","body":"> Do you have a custom editor theme set up? It may not be compatible with theme changes in 4.6.\n\nNot sure this counts as a \"new theme\", but a long time ago (around 4.1) I changed a few details in Text Editor like some highlight colors, and I turned off the minimap… minor things like that. I also use a non-default font if that matters. I don't remember changing much more than that.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3791515198/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3791537940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115287#issuecomment-3791537940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115287","id":3791537940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7h_kcU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T17:59:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T17:59:56Z","body":"You can try to reset your editor settings to see if they're causing the problem:\n\n- Access the folder with settings with Editor > Open Editor Settings Folder in Godot\n- Copy the `editor_settings-4.6.tres` to back it up (e.g. rename it with `.bkp` extension)\n- Open `editor_settings-4.6.tres` in a text editor and delete all content to reinitialize the config (you could also delete it, but by default Godot will initialize the config with that of the previous Godot version you used, so it would copy settings from `editor_settings-4.5.tres` and likely reproduce the same issue)\n\nIf that works, then it could be useful to have a copy of your original `editor_settings-4.6.tres` to see what causes the issue and whether it's just a bad configuration, or something we should aim to work around in Godot.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3791537940/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3791605317","html_url":