r":{"login":"inhalt120g","id":106015575,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGrVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106015575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g","html_url":"https://github.com/inhalt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T20:25:54Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T20:25:54Z","body":"> You can try to reset your editor settings to see if they're causing the problem:\n> \n> * Access the folder with settings with Editor > Open Editor Settings Folder in Godot\n> * Copy the `editor_settings-4.6.tres` to back it up (e.g. rename it with `.bkp` extension)\n> * Open `editor_settings-4.6.tres` in a text editor and delete all content to reinitialize the config (you could also delete it, but by default Godot will initialize the config with that of the previous Godot version you used, so it would copy settings from `editor_settings-4.5.tres` and likely reproduce the same issue)\n> \n> If that works, then it could be useful to have a copy of your original `editor_settings-4.6.tres` to see what causes the issue and whether it's just a bad configuration, or something we should aim to work around in Godot.\n\nI did it, this is what it looks like now with \"modern / default\" setting:\n<img width=\"1264\" height=\"944\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a82f026f-c56f-4426-a690-0e19bd3a7d8a\" />\nWhich is still crazy dark but I think that's by design?\n\nHere is \"Black OLED\":\n<img width=\"1220\" height=\"900\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91adcba0-5853-44ce-a7a2-62cb3b7d9d6f\" />\nok I can at least read the text.\n\nThe light theme (which I use) looks like before so that's good.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3792250404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3792361084","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115287#issuecomment-3792361084","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115287","id":3792361084,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iCtZ8","user":{"login":"inhalt120g","id":106015575,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGrVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106015575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g","html_url":"https://github.com/inhalt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T20:49:04Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T20:49:04Z","body":"Here are the three settings files:\n\n[アーカイブ.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24829103/default.zip)\n\neditor_settings-4.6 broken.tres : using this makes everything too dark\neditor_settings-4.6 works.tres : this is the one that was generated following the instructions from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115287#issuecomment-3791537940\neditor_settings-4.6.tres : this is what I currently use","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3792361084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3796389814","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115287#issuecomment-3796389814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115287","id":3796389814,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iSE-2","user":{"login":"lostminds","id":17763524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYzNTI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17763524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds","html_url":"https://github.com/lostminds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lostminds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-25T10:14:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-25T10:14:26Z","body":"> Looking at screenshots, window title buttons look black, which should not happen, and these buttons are not drawn by Godot but by OS, so it might be not theme related. Not sure what could cause something like this.\n\nI haven't see this on the current build on macOS either. But could this be related to this old issue (closed as I could no longer reproduce it and there were no other reports) https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96806 as it looks similar?\n\nMy guess was that it could be related to the system light/dark theme. If you use light theme for macOS it will have a standard label color (like NSColor.controlTextColor) that is light in dark mode but dark in light mode. And that this then somehow bleeds into Godot if these colors are used to set the theme colors? Or if they're referenced directly triggers the color swap if the Godot window doesn't correctly identify itself as dark or light mode themed. To test this try changing your macOS system theme to dark mode (assuming you don't use that already) and see if these colors change when the theme colors are set. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3796389814/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]